abstract: >-
  A strategic framework for mission-critical continuity during legacy-to-cloud 
  transformations in the Finance, Healthcare, and Insurance industries. 
  This research addresses the 'Modernization Trap' by utilizing resilient 
  CDC-driven pipelines for multi-year system coexistence.
